# Engine

- Keep adjudication deterministic for a given clock + config.
- Add or update tests under `tests/` (golden / determinism / domain-specific) with engine changes.
- Prefer extending existing modules (`adjudicate`, `pricing`, `quantity-limit`, `replay`) over new parallel paths.
